{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y把部分关键因果和心理细节压短了，例如 S05 无意间没藏住喜欢的过程、S13 明知没人能保证永远的清醒认识，人物动机的来龙去脉不如 X 完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的短句和【】加亮让我能迅速抓住每段的情绪转折，不必先读完长句才能理解发生了什么；感受又有大小层级，部分随音乐进程出现，比较适合边听边扫。它还把水面、小船、旋律回返和结尾回应串成了有呼应的整体，感受的身体细节和音乐变化也更具体。X 的优势是人物心理解释更充分，但整体呈现不如 Y 容易抓重点，音乐与文字的同步感也较弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f61578c-c3ec-4e44-85b6-14b105847de8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T170927705638Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T17:10:58.435897+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a5bf62049c67510908a70ddbfb0699e7e72eb979737216e3f31cfdb1fca7b18", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp